# Evaluation artifacts are VERSIONED on purpose. They are the measured evidence
# behind the implementation, they are small, and keeping them out of git had a real
# cost: a smoke run with a reduced sweep silently destroyed the full 160-row
# dataset with no way to recover it, because nothing tracked the file.
